data: {"messages":[{"content":"请对视频中的人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域进行模糊处理，输出一份可以公开使用的脱敏视频。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"2bf5f7c4-bc5b-4d8c-b9e0-bdf19a4ec4f9"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n    <skill>\n      <name>location-matcher</name>\n      <description>当需要通过街景照片、文字描述、地标名称、建筑物特征、道路信息、商铺招牌等视觉或语义线索来定位实际地点的准确地址或经纬度时，使用此 skill。典型触发场景包括：1）询问照片拍摄位置（如\"这张照片在哪里拍的？\"、\"这是哪个街道？\"）；2）根据文字描述查找地点（如\"有一个LAFORET SELECT招牌的地方在哪里？\"、\"描述中的十字路口对应什么位置？\"）；3）验证某地点是否存在街景记录（如\"XX路XX号有街景吗？\"、\"数据库里有这个位置的街景图像吗？\"）；4）地址与坐标互转后的位置确认（如\"这个地址对应的街景长什么样？\"、\"这个经纬度是什么地方？\"）；5）询问图片中的建筑在哪里（如\"找到有这个红色邮筒的街道\"、\"这个大厦在哪里？\"）</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/street_view_image/location-matcher/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"a220cde8-eb02-4e86-9a4a-36d18ad58706"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：场景：街景图像。场景ID：street_view_image\n识别场景：街景图像 (street_view_image)；场景模式：single；候选场景：street_view_image\n任务切分：\n- 请对视频中的人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域进行模糊处理，输出一份可以公开使用的脱敏视频。\n任务规划：\n1. 读取输入视频文件并解析基础元数据，按预设采样策略提取视频帧序列，建立帧索引与时间戳映射表，输出结构化待处理帧数据集。\n2. 依托街景图像场景的空间分析能力，在视频帧中部署隐私目标检测算法，精准定位人脸、车牌及其他敏感区域边界框，记录坐标位置与置信度指标，输出带空间标注的检测清单。\n3. 根据检测清单对对应帧的敏感区域执行高斯模糊或马赛克遮挡操作，设定覆盖半径与平滑阈值以确保隐私完全遮蔽且不破坏非敏感背景，输出逐帧脱敏图像序列。\n4. 将脱敏图像序列按原始时序重建视频流，执行跨帧掩码一致性校验与编码格式转换，排查动态模糊伪影与残留像素点，输出符合技术标准的中间视频文件。\n5. 生成处理过程日志与脱敏质量核验报告，封装最终视频文件并提供公开可用格式的导出接口，完成脱敏交付物的归档与分发准备。\n场景任务：\n- street_view_image: 我将对街景视频中的脸、车牌和其他敏感区域进行模糊处理，输出一份可公开使用的脱敏视频。；参数：{'图像对象': '视频', '定位目标': '人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域模糊处理'}\n已提取参数：{'图像对象': '视频', '定位目标': '人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域模糊处理'}\n任务提示：\n- 提取必填参数：图像对象。需要定位的街景图像、道路图像、城市街景或上传图片\n- 提取可选参数：定位目标。用户希望的定位结果形式，如经纬度坐标、道路名称、区域位置、POI匹配等\n- 提取可选参数：匹配范围。可选的位置匹配范围限制，如城市名称、行政区域或道路网范围\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"ae676d84-fd77-4a93-b4f6-3e7bbfb664f8"},{"content":"我需要了解一些信息才能为您处理视频脱敏。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":273,"prompt_tokens":10982,"total_tokens":11255,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":213,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":273},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10982}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-7b351336-643a-9bb1-aac5-93918d54616e","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e34-917e-7511-90d8-00cd46200352-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"ls","args":{"description":"查看用户上传的视频文件","path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads"},"id":"call_09b7424f91e84e27b8530a35","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10982,"output_tokens":273,"total_tokens":11255,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":213}}},{"content":"/mnt/user-data/uploads","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"ls","id":"bea62d44-6b5c-4b18-ad6b-a993667aa674","tool_call_id":"call_09b7424f91e84e27b8530a35","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"当前上传目录中还没有视频文件。请提供您需要脱敏处理的视频文件，您可以：\n\n1. **直接上传视频文件**到对话中\n2. **告诉我视频的完整路径**（如果已存放在服务器上的话）\n\n另外，为了给出更精准的处理方案，也想确认一下：\n- 您希望模糊处理的具体目标除了**人脸、车牌**外，还有哪些敏感区域？（例如：门牌号、条形码、水印等）\n- 对模糊效果有偏好吗？高斯模糊还是马赛克遮挡？","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":300,"prompt_tokens":11060,"total_tokens":11360,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":183,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":300},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":11060}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-f20f2792-341a-98c9-afa6-dac97b31a427","finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e35-3d3e-79b3-a5f3-129c6df97551-0","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":11060,"output_tokens":300,"total_tokens":11360,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":183}}}],"viewed_images":{},"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/e2a13e96-9885-4ab6-b104-53e1db835f78/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/e2a13e96-9885-4ab6-b104-53e1db835f78/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/e2a13e96-9885-4ab6-b104-53e1db835f78/user-data/outputs"},"title":"视频脱敏处理","raw_messages":[{"content":"请对视频中的人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域进行模糊处理，输出一份可以公开使用的脱敏视频。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"2bf5f7c4-bc5b-4d8c-b9e0-bdf19a4ec4f9"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n    <skill>\n      <name>location-matcher</name>\n      <description>当需要通过街景照片、文字描述、地标名称、建筑物特征、道路信息、商铺招牌等视觉或语义线索来定位实际地点的准确地址或经纬度时，使用此 skill。典型触发场景包括：1）询问照片拍摄位置（如\"这张照片在哪里拍的？\"、\"这是哪个街道？\"）；2）根据文字描述查找地点（如\"有一个LAFORET SELECT招牌的地方在哪里？\"、\"描述中的十字路口对应什么位置？\"）；3）验证某地点是否存在街景记录（如\"XX路XX号有街景吗？\"、\"数据库里有这个位置的街景图像吗？\"）；4）地址与坐标互转后的位置确认（如\"这个地址对应的街景长什么样？\"、\"这个经纬度是什么地方？\"）；5）询问图片中的建筑在哪里（如\"找到有这个红色邮筒的街道\"、\"这个大厦在哪里？\"）</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/street_view_image/location-matcher/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"a220cde8-eb02-4e86-9a4a-36d18ad58706"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：场景：街景图像。场景ID：street_view_image\n识别场景：街景图像 (street_view_image)；场景模式：single；候选场景：street_view_image\n任务切分：\n- 请对视频中的人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域进行模糊处理，输出一份可以公开使用的脱敏视频。\n任务规划：\n1. 读取输入视频文件并解析基础元数据，按预设采样策略提取视频帧序列，建立帧索引与时间戳映射表，输出结构化待处理帧数据集。\n2. 依托街景图像场景的空间分析能力，在视频帧中部署隐私目标检测算法，精准定位人脸、车牌及其他敏感区域边界框，记录坐标位置与置信度指标，输出带空间标注的检测清单。\n3. 根据检测清单对对应帧的敏感区域执行高斯模糊或马赛克遮挡操作，设定覆盖半径与平滑阈值以确保隐私完全遮蔽且不破坏非敏感背景，输出逐帧脱敏图像序列。\n4. 将脱敏图像序列按原始时序重建视频流，执行跨帧掩码一致性校验与编码格式转换，排查动态模糊伪影与残留像素点，输出符合技术标准的中间视频文件。\n5. 生成处理过程日志与脱敏质量核验报告，封装最终视频文件并提供公开可用格式的导出接口，完成脱敏交付物的归档与分发准备。\n场景任务：\n- street_view_image: 我将对街景视频中的脸、车牌和其他敏感区域进行模糊处理，输出一份可公开使用的脱敏视频。；参数：{'图像对象': '视频', '定位目标': '人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域模糊处理'}\n已提取参数：{'图像对象': '视频', '定位目标': '人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域模糊处理'}\n任务提示：\n- 提取必填参数：图像对象。需要定位的街景图像、道路图像、城市街景或上传图片\n- 提取可选参数：定位目标。用户希望的定位结果形式，如经纬度坐标、道路名称、区域位置、POI匹配等\n- 提取可选参数：匹配范围。可选的位置匹配范围限制，如城市名称、行政区域或道路网范围\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"ae676d84-fd77-4a93-b4f6-3e7bbfb664f8"},{"content":"我需要了解一些信息才能为您处理视频脱敏。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":273,"prompt_tokens":10982,"total_tokens":11255,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":213,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":273},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10982}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-7b351336-643a-9bb1-aac5-93918d54616e","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e34-917e-7511-90d8-00cd46200352-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"ls","args":{"description":"查看用户上传的视频文件","path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads"},"id":"call_09b7424f91e84e27b8530a35","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10982,"output_tokens":273,"total_tokens":11255,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":213}}},{"content":"/mnt/user-data/uploads","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"ls","id":"bea62d44-6b5c-4b18-ad6b-a993667aa674","tool_call_id":"call_09b7424f91e84e27b8530a35","artifact":null,"status":"success"}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请对视频中的人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域进行模糊处理，输出一份可以公开使用的脱敏视频。","normalized_query":"请对视频中的人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域进行模糊处理，输出一份可以公开使用的脱敏视频。","routing_query":"场景：街景图像。场景ID：street_view_image。场景说明：街景图像地理位置识别、定位匹配、位置推断、坐标关联和位置校验场景。主要用于识别用户上传街景图像的地理位置并进行定位匹配。需要识别参数：图像对象、定位目标、匹配范围。用户原始问题：我将对街景视频中的脸、车牌和其他敏感区域进行模糊处理，输出一份可公开使用的脱敏视频","scene":"street_view_image","scene_name":"街景图像","params":{"图像对象":"视频","定位目标":"人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域模糊处理"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["street_view_image"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_c53414","text":"请对视频中的人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域进行模糊处理，输出一份可以公开使用的脱敏视频。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_5ba27c","text":"读取输入视频文件并解析基础元数据，按预设采样策略提取视频帧序列，建立帧索引与时间戳映射表，输出结构化待处理帧数据集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_4b52fe","text":"依托街景图像场景的空间分析能力，在视频帧中部署隐私目标检测算法，精准定位人脸、车牌及其他敏感区域边界框，记录坐标位置与置信度指标，输出带空间标注的检测清单。"},{"task_span_id":"span_a94c73","text":"根据检测清单对对应帧的敏感区域执行高斯模糊或马赛克遮挡操作，设定覆盖半径与平滑阈值以确保隐私完全遮蔽且不破坏非敏感背景，输出逐帧脱敏图像序列。"},{"task_span_id":"span_6a376a","text":"将脱敏图像序列按原始时序重建视频流，执行跨帧掩码一致性校验与编码格式转换，排查动态模糊伪影与残留像素点，输出符合技术标准的中间视频文件。"},{"task_span_id":"span_a59ac4","text":"生成处理过程日志与脱敏质量核验报告，封装最终视频文件并提供公开可用格式的导出接口，完成脱敏交付物的归档与分发准备。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_1a653a","scene":"street_view_image","scene_name":"街景图像","text":"我将对街景视频中的脸、车牌和其他敏感区域进行模糊处理，输出一份可公开使用的脱敏视频。","params":{"图像对象":"视频","定位目标":"人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域模糊处理"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_1a653a","scene":"street_view_image","scene_name":"街景图像","text":"我将对街景视频中的脸、车牌和其他敏感区域进行模糊处理，输出一份可公开使用的脱敏视频。","params":{"图像对象":"视频","定位目标":"人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域模糊处理"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：图像对象。需要定位的街景图像、道路图像、城市街景或上传图片","提取可选参数：定位目标。用户希望的定位结果形式，如经纬度坐标、道路名称、区域位置、POI匹配等","提取可选参数：匹配范围。可选的位置匹配范围限制，如城市名称、行政区域或道路网范围"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:2bf5f7c4-bc5b-4d8c-b9e0-bdf19a4ec4f9"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"请对视频中的人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域进行模糊处理，输出一份可以公开使用的脱敏视频。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"请对视频中的人脸、车牌和其他敏感区域进行模糊处理，输出一份可以公开使用的脱敏视频。","scene":"street_view_image","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"location-matcher","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["location-matcher"],"d